# Student files stay out of git. Only the README files in these folders are tracked.
재료/*
!재료/README.md
!재료/sfx/
결과/*
!결과/README.md
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
!재료/sfx/*.mp3
!재료/sfx/sources.json
*.m4a

# Prompt logs written by local agent hooks
prompts/

# API keys the student pastes with 키-입력.bat. Never commit or send these. (env-template.txt is the empty template and stays tracked.)
.env
.env.*
*.env
